# settings-light-dark-system (H1): system selected with the system scheme light.
# No stored picks (defaults: system, arctic-ice, clean-teal), so the resolved
# scheme is the system's light: message "Your system is light right now.",
# legend "LIGHT THEME", Clean Teal row checked (bold + check, no bg change).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme light
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 500
shot settings-light-dark-system
